WEBVTT

00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:26.290
<b>Chaika the Coffin Princess</b>

00:00:26.290 --> 00:00:27.050
<b>Chaika the Coffin Princess</b>

00:01:46.050 --> 00:01:47.860
The water looks clear.

00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:50.420
We're gonna dive, Akari.

00:02:20.690 --> 00:02:22.750
I can't tell how far away the exit is.

00:02:26.360 --> 00:02:27.960
I am steel.

00:03:04.700 --> 00:03:05.720
This is...

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:07.770
The end of the road for you.

00:03:11.990 --> 00:03:13.210
Brother Shin?

00:03:13.930 --> 00:03:16.390
Are you... Brother Shin?

00:03:16.390 --> 00:03:17.420
Why are you here?

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:20.660
Are you in the tournament, too?

00:03:21.220 --> 00:03:22.640
Are you after the remains?

00:03:23.050 --> 00:03:24.840
I'm not like you.

00:03:24.840 --> 00:03:27.720
You're not working for Hartgen, are you?

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:49.500
You still haven't gotten the idea?

00:03:50.130 --> 00:03:53.480
I told you... You're not 
cut out to be a saboteur.

00:03:53.480 --> 00:03:55.670
That's for me to decide!

00:04:07.830 --> 00:04:11.310
Black Agenda

00:04:17.280 --> 00:04:18.810
Toru! Akari!

00:04:23.250 --> 00:04:24.860
I have report.

00:04:25.140 --> 00:04:26.190
What's up?

00:04:26.600 --> 00:04:29.120
Niva fled. Unknown person took away.

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:32.370
Guy? Why would he take her?

00:04:32.770 --> 00:04:35.620
Details unknown. Niva, no fear.

00:04:36.230 --> 00:04:39.030
What relationship with unknown person?

00:04:39.810 --> 00:04:43.440
When we met Guy at the 
beach and he saw Niva,

00:04:43.440 --> 00:04:45.630
he said, "So it was you all who got her."

00:04:45.990 --> 00:04:49.710
He must have known that Niva was a weapon.

00:04:50.410 --> 00:04:52.520
I always thought he seemed shady...

00:04:53.310 --> 00:04:57.310
If Hartgen has the last remains, 
we have no need for Guy.

00:04:58.040 --> 00:05:00.550
Chaika, don't talk to him anymore.

00:05:01.170 --> 00:05:01.780
Right.

00:05:02.340 --> 00:05:04.470
Find remains location?

00:05:04.470 --> 00:05:06.920
Sorry. We didn't find anything.

00:05:06.920 --> 00:05:08.620
Explain situation.

00:05:09.390 --> 00:05:11.040
We ran into the worst enemy possible.

00:05:11.850 --> 00:05:15.010
It seems our mentor is working for Hartgen.

00:05:15.010 --> 00:05:18.560
Shocking truth! Fight with mentor?

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:19.790
You don't need to worry.

00:05:20.430 --> 00:05:22.780
It's not unusual for saboteurs to become

00:05:22.780 --> 00:05:25.760
enemies in battle if they 
have different employers.

00:05:26.290 --> 00:05:29.460
Brother and I have long 
been prepared for that.

00:05:30.240 --> 00:05:32.470
Even if Brother were to become my enemy,

00:05:33.010 --> 00:05:37.170
I'm prepared to have him lick 
my feet and beg for his life

00:05:37.170 --> 00:05:39.480
as I beat him, bind him, 
and drip candle wax on him.

00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:42.290
That has nothing to do with 
a saboteur's resolve.

00:05:42.680 --> 00:05:43.790
Toru...

00:05:43.790 --> 00:05:46.620
Chaika, do you have enough magic fuel?

00:05:46.620 --> 00:05:48.360
Yes. Have plenty.

00:05:48.750 --> 00:05:52.080
Good. It wouldn't be funny 
if we ran out of ammo.

00:05:52.790 --> 00:05:56.080
And no using your memories in 
place of magic fuel, okay?

00:05:56.080 --> 00:05:57.430
No worry.

00:05:58.090 --> 00:06:01.790
From the looks of things, 
no matter who wins the tournament,

00:06:01.790 --> 00:06:04.340
I don't think Hartgen intends 
to give away the remains.

00:06:05.010 --> 00:06:08.040
Either way, Chaika and I will 
enter the tournament as planned,

00:06:08.040 --> 00:06:10.910
rise in the ranks, and get 
close to the remains.

00:06:11.530 --> 00:06:13.090
Akari, as soon as it starts,

00:06:13.090 --> 00:06:16.230
you and Fredrica get into the 
castle and search for the remains.

00:06:16.590 --> 00:06:18.440
If you find them, steal them.

00:06:18.440 --> 00:06:20.100
Isn't that just dragging things out?

00:06:20.620 --> 00:06:24.200
Toru, can't we just form a contract, 
beat up the other fighters,

00:06:24.200 --> 00:06:27.990
then bust into the castle 
and take the remains?

00:06:28.260 --> 00:06:31.240
No, we don't know the inside of the castle,

00:06:31.240 --> 00:06:33.230
and we don't know how our enemies are.

00:06:33.230 --> 00:06:34.860
It's dangerous to let you run wild.

00:06:34.860 --> 00:06:36.870
Aww. What a pain.

00:06:37.240 --> 00:06:39.450
The remains probably aren't 
underground anymore.

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:41.960
Search for them again while we have time.

00:06:41.960 --> 00:06:42.840
Right.

00:06:46.110 --> 00:06:48.340
Come, resounding perception.

00:06:49.050 --> 00:06:50.970
The Locator!

00:06:52.840 --> 00:06:55.670
Remains, likely, top of castle.

00:07:00.070 --> 00:07:02.350
This is the emperor's fortune?

00:07:02.350 --> 00:07:04.940
It's not what I imagined at all.

00:07:05.350 --> 00:07:08.940
I don't know what you two were imagining,

00:07:09.430 --> 00:07:11.070
but that is indeed what this is.

00:07:13.210 --> 00:07:14.490
She becomes a weapon?

00:07:14.870 --> 00:07:17.600
At the right time, and when 
the conditions are met,

00:07:18.240 --> 00:07:23.000
it is indeed capable of plunging 
the world into war again.

00:07:23.510 --> 00:07:25.110
Conditions...

00:07:25.110 --> 00:07:29.580
Those should all come 
together at this tournament.

00:07:29.580 --> 00:07:31.380
Then you have no need to worry.

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:34.010
All because I've had your help.

00:07:34.520 --> 00:07:36.830
It has taken a long time...

00:07:37.530 --> 00:07:42.810
You have no idea how I've waited 
for war to begin again.

00:07:43.080 --> 00:07:44.550
It is ironic, isn't it?

00:07:45.030 --> 00:07:47.210
The one who cut off Emperor Gaz's head

00:07:47.210 --> 00:07:50.780
and brought an end to 300 years of war

00:07:50.780 --> 00:07:52.820
was none other than you.

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:55.570
Yes... I was foolish.

00:07:56.530 --> 00:08:01.350
Back then, I made a mistake 
that could never be undone.

00:08:11.710 --> 00:08:16.810
Victory is ours!

00:08:29.510 --> 00:08:32.240
I shouldn't have ended the war.

00:08:32.660 --> 00:08:37.020
Battle is what gave purpose to our lives.

00:08:37.750 --> 00:08:39.560
Come, you two.

00:08:40.450 --> 00:08:43.570
I can't wait to see your true form.

00:08:51.570 --> 00:08:53.180
Listen to me!

00:08:53.180 --> 00:08:55.250
The match will soon begin.

00:08:55.710 --> 00:08:58.370
There are two battlefields 
within the second castle wall,

00:08:58.370 --> 00:09:00.850
and another within the third.

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:03.540
Only the victors in this battle

00:09:03.540 --> 00:09:05.600
will be permitted to enter the castle.

00:09:06.340 --> 00:09:08.750
You must defeat three opposing teams,

00:09:08.750 --> 00:09:11.860
and take their arm bands 
as proof of your victory.

00:09:12.490 --> 00:09:16.110
Give the armbands you've collected 
to the guard at the checkpoint.

00:09:16.110 --> 00:09:20.250
Those who rank highest may 
proceed to the next phase.

00:09:20.920 --> 00:09:23.990
Devote all your strength to this battle!

00:09:29.480 --> 00:09:32.960
King Hartgen will now deliver an address.

00:09:37.160 --> 00:09:40.390
I know that all of the 
warriors gathered here today

00:09:40.390 --> 00:09:44.310
have not forgotten their pride as warriors.

00:09:45.140 --> 00:09:48.140
What do you feel in this world 
that has been immersed in

00:09:48.140 --> 00:09:50.190
peace for five years since the war?

00:09:50.760 --> 00:09:54.560
Do you not feel aggrieved to live 
in a world in which you cannot use

00:09:54.560 --> 00:09:56.650
the strength and techniques 
you learned in battle?

00:09:58.340 --> 00:10:01.490
I will transform this tedious world!

00:10:02.050 --> 00:10:05.070
This continent needs an absolute ruler.

00:10:05.450 --> 00:10:07.530
I will take on that role,

00:10:07.530 --> 00:10:11.360
and create a world in which 
warriors live as warriors!

00:10:13.340 --> 00:10:16.600
I will use my power to seize this continent!

00:10:17.220 --> 00:10:20.550
Warriors, those who sympathize with me,

00:10:20.550 --> 00:10:23.680
demonstrate your strength to your 
hearts' content in this tournament!

00:10:25.770 --> 00:10:28.020
He wants war, too?

00:10:28.400 --> 00:10:30.440
Any who are weak, leave now!

00:10:30.440 --> 00:10:33.320
Any who can fight, show me your strength!

00:10:37.830 --> 00:10:39.590
Such fools.

00:10:39.990 --> 00:10:44.200
Well, no matter. 
They are Father's playthings.

00:10:44.940 --> 00:10:46.740
My wish is...

00:10:50.110 --> 00:10:51.370
Dear Sister.

00:10:51.370 --> 00:10:52.980
This is where you were?

00:10:52.980 --> 00:10:53.630
Yes.

00:10:53.630 --> 00:10:55.420
Three this year...

00:10:55.420 --> 00:10:58.630
No, more accurately, two and a half.

00:10:58.630 --> 00:10:59.800
Yes.

00:11:00.050 --> 00:11:02.310
Tell the guards

00:11:02.310 --> 00:11:06.680
to come up with some arbitrary 
reason to bring the Chaikas to me.

00:11:06.680 --> 00:11:08.370
You're going to make them fight?

00:11:08.370 --> 00:11:09.310
How fun!

00:11:09.540 --> 00:11:13.010
Aren't you curious to 
see which is strongest?

00:11:15.940 --> 00:11:17.400
Begin!

00:11:22.270 --> 00:11:22.990
Let's go.

00:11:23.130 --> 00:11:24.070
Right.

00:11:46.810 --> 00:11:48.020
The Shield!

00:11:54.610 --> 00:11:55.980
Great job, Chaika.

00:11:55.980 --> 00:11:58.680
Yes! Claudia's advice, useful!

00:11:58.680 --> 00:11:59.770
Yeah.

00:11:59.770 --> 00:12:01.150
Long time, no see.

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:03.610
I thought you'd be here.

00:12:03.940 --> 00:12:05.160
You're...

00:12:05.160 --> 00:12:08.100
Silver hair... Purple eyes...

00:12:08.100 --> 00:12:09.730
Don't say any more than that.

00:12:09.730 --> 00:12:11.600
A lot has happened to us.

00:12:14.600 --> 00:12:16.420
Why are you guys here?

00:12:16.700 --> 00:12:18.800
To capture all of you.

00:12:18.800 --> 00:12:21.080
We've infiltrated this castle 
and are investigating.

00:12:21.560 --> 00:12:24.660
When we're done, 
we'll capture you, so be ready.

00:12:24.660 --> 00:12:27.430
But what about you? Why are you fighting?

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:30.060
Goal, win tournament prize.

00:12:30.430 --> 00:12:32.610
You're not working with Hartgen?

00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:36.380
You took the emperor's fortune from his lab

00:12:36.380 --> 00:12:38.310
and brought it to Hartgen, didn't you?

00:12:38.310 --> 00:12:39.670
The emperor's fortune?

00:12:39.670 --> 00:12:41.420
Don't play dumb!

00:12:41.420 --> 00:12:44.950
We know the white Chaika took his 
fortune, the Gundo, from that lab.

00:12:45.260 --> 00:12:46.280
Gundo?

00:12:47.400 --> 00:12:48.360
Niva?

00:12:48.720 --> 00:12:50.200
She was the fortune?

00:12:50.200 --> 00:12:53.410
As I suspected. So where is she?

00:12:53.850 --> 00:12:56.330
Niva left with unknown person.

00:12:56.330 --> 00:12:58.580
Who's this "unknown person"?

00:12:58.580 --> 00:13:00.840
Some shady bastard called Guy.

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:02.090
Did you say Guy?

00:13:02.350 --> 00:13:03.750
You know him?

00:13:04.190 --> 00:13:06.340
He called me "Chaika."

00:13:06.840 --> 00:13:08.900
He seemed to know about the Chaikas.

00:13:09.650 --> 00:13:13.930
Unknown person brings me 
information about remains.

00:13:13.930 --> 00:13:15.940
What exactly is he?

00:13:15.940 --> 00:13:17.190
I'm not sure.

00:13:17.690 --> 00:13:21.670
He shows up out of nowhere and 
then disappears, like a ghost.

00:13:22.210 --> 00:13:25.210
I figured he must be under someone's orders.

00:13:25.210 --> 00:13:26.590
Like who?

00:13:27.200 --> 00:13:29.650
He had opportunities to take Niva,

00:13:29.650 --> 00:13:32.290
but for some reason, the moment 
we entered this castle,

00:13:32.290 --> 00:13:34.150
that's when he took her.

00:13:34.150 --> 00:13:36.960
So I suspect Guy is connected to Hartgen.

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:41.590
Did you know that there are twin 
black Chaikas with Hartgen?

00:13:42.370 --> 00:13:43.710
Black Chaika exists?!

00:13:43.710 --> 00:13:45.390
You didn't know?

00:13:45.390 --> 00:13:48.190
Perhaps Hartgen is working with the

00:13:48.190 --> 00:13:50.850
black Chaikas to gather 
the remains, like you.

00:13:55.880 --> 00:13:58.270
Don't think you can get away from us!

00:13:58.270 --> 00:13:59.900
Come, to strike and crush!

00:14:00.210 --> 00:14:01.540
The Slugger!

00:14:10.120 --> 00:14:11.280
Toru?

00:14:12.160 --> 00:14:14.220
Twin black Chaikas...

00:14:14.880 --> 00:14:16.490
What is he after?

00:14:20.990 --> 00:14:23.740
Hard to believe he's been 
doing this for five years.

00:14:23.740 --> 00:14:26.250
What sort of man is Hartgen?

00:14:26.570 --> 00:14:27.760
I don't know.

00:14:28.290 --> 00:14:32.610
I heard he was the man who beheaded 
the emperor and his daughter.

00:14:32.610 --> 00:14:34.260
I didn't see it, though.

00:14:34.890 --> 00:14:38.430
I suppose he must have 
been a worthy fighter.

00:14:39.730 --> 00:14:42.340
Given that he holds martial 
arts tournaments like this,

00:14:42.730 --> 00:14:46.590
Hartgen must be unhappy with 
the fact that the war ended.

00:14:46.990 --> 00:14:48.490
Who knows?

00:14:52.110 --> 00:14:54.160
What about you, Akari?

00:14:54.880 --> 00:14:56.830
Well, I'm...

00:15:07.320 --> 00:15:09.560
Let us have the report from 
the Kliemann Organization.

00:15:10.000 --> 00:15:10.720
Yes, sir.

00:15:11.250 --> 00:15:13.320
I'd like to have my aide,

00:15:13.320 --> 00:15:17.340
Miss Bombardier, deliver our 
report from the Gillette Squad.

00:15:18.720 --> 00:15:21.520
We've located Emperor Gaz's 
secret lab on a remote island

00:15:21.520 --> 00:15:24.290
in the waters off the port town of Waronti.

00:15:25.830 --> 00:15:28.220
There was a powerful Gundo there that

00:15:28.220 --> 00:15:30.400
we assumed to be the emperor's fortune,

00:15:30.400 --> 00:15:33.690
but the white Chaika had already 
taken it from the lab.

00:15:33.690 --> 00:15:34.970
What?

00:15:34.970 --> 00:15:36.830
This is merely speculation,

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:41.040
but we believe Chaika has fled 
to the Principality of Hartgen.

00:15:41.040 --> 00:15:43.950
She's taking the Gundo to the 
Principality of Hartgen?!

00:15:43.950 --> 00:15:45.770
We can't delay any longer!

00:15:45.770 --> 00:15:47.170
We must deal with this now!

00:15:47.580 --> 00:15:49.030
Chief Konrad.

00:15:49.530 --> 00:15:52.820
Did the King of Hartgen 
accept your request to

00:15:52.820 --> 00:15:54.980
cancel the martial arts tournament?

00:15:55.330 --> 00:16:00.140
I believe the Gillette Squad will 
report to us shortly regarding that.

00:16:00.600 --> 00:16:02.410
You're being too complacent.

00:16:02.410 --> 00:16:04.230
We should send an army immediately!

00:16:04.590 --> 00:16:08.650
My nation would rather not 
send out any more soldiers.

00:16:08.650 --> 00:16:11.650
Then make them contribute 
weapons or war funds!

00:16:11.650 --> 00:16:15.540
Now, wait a moment. Are you set on war?

00:16:15.920 --> 00:16:17.960
If you attack the Principality of Hartgen,

00:16:17.960 --> 00:16:21.540
the adjoining nations will 
suffer great losses.

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:24.790
We need to think of the continent 
as a whole right now!

00:16:25.120 --> 00:16:28.380
It's plain as day that we cannot 
just set Hartgen aside!

00:16:28.380 --> 00:16:30.020
I agree.

00:16:30.020 --> 00:16:32.940
I've heard rumors that forty 
to fifty thousand soldiers

00:16:32.940 --> 00:16:34.930
have gathered in the Principality of Hartgen.

00:16:36.750 --> 00:16:40.680
No, I find it hard to believe that 
he has expanded his army

00:16:40.680 --> 00:16:42.600
that much in five years since the war.

00:16:42.850 --> 00:16:45.520
Regardless, we should avoid

00:16:45.520 --> 00:16:48.630
recklessly starting a war 
or shedding blood in vain.

00:16:49.070 --> 00:16:51.190
We should await the Kliemann 
Organization's report

00:16:51.190 --> 00:16:54.470
and reach a decision under the 
consensus of the entire allied army.

00:16:59.730 --> 00:17:02.400
Investigations by our spies have revealed

00:17:02.400 --> 00:17:05.480
that the tournament has already begun.

00:17:05.480 --> 00:17:06.660
I see...

00:17:07.050 --> 00:17:09.380
The Kliemann Organization is too slow.

00:17:09.710 --> 00:17:16.160
That man, Fyodor, who took over General 
Cizeta's position, is too cautious, as well.

00:17:16.160 --> 00:17:19.390
Can we afford to be so complacent?

00:17:19.860 --> 00:17:22.650
That's what I'd like to speak to you about.

00:17:22.650 --> 00:17:26.520
We will contribute wizards 
and magic fuel to the cause.

00:17:27.850 --> 00:17:32.190
Are you asking my nation to send 
our floating fortress Cima?

00:17:32.470 --> 00:17:35.770
Yes. I believe it is 
necessary to prepare it.

00:17:37.620 --> 00:17:38.620
What is this?

00:17:39.000 --> 00:17:41.840
The report from the force 
that subjugated Emperor Gaz,

00:17:41.840 --> 00:17:44.730
and a blueprint of a floating fortress 
that we found in our library.

00:17:45.440 --> 00:17:48.380
However, it's over a hundred years old.

00:17:48.380 --> 00:17:50.170
A hundred years?

00:17:50.550 --> 00:17:52.580
I can't believe that even the Gaz Empire

00:17:52.580 --> 00:17:56.880
could have had such advanced 
technology that long ago...

00:17:56.880 --> 00:18:01.030
Yes. But according to the 
Gillette Squad's report,

00:18:01.030 --> 00:18:03.940
several structures resembling this were seen

00:18:03.940 --> 00:18:07.530
near the Gaz Empire border 
nearly a hundred years ago.

00:18:08.240 --> 00:18:11.880
The people who saw them called 
them "overnight castles."

00:18:12.530 --> 00:18:17.750
It seems the magical technology of the 
Gaz Empire exceeded our expectations...

00:18:18.290 --> 00:18:19.710
General Fyodor,

00:18:20.560 --> 00:18:24.660
many details on Chaika and Emperor 
Gaz have remained obscure,

00:18:24.660 --> 00:18:28.420
and they have been disparaged by 
the Council of the Six Nations.

00:18:28.420 --> 00:18:33.250
But my men have devoted their 
sincerest efforts to this matter.

00:18:33.680 --> 00:18:36.810
Chaika was involved in the Soara incident.

00:18:36.810 --> 00:18:41.760
And now, if Chaika is making 
her way to King Hartgen...

00:18:41.760 --> 00:18:46.130
I have met King Hartgen in the past.

00:18:46.130 --> 00:18:48.710
He gave me the impression 
of an honest man...

00:18:49.580 --> 00:18:50.440
Enter.

00:18:51.470 --> 00:18:54.650
Pardon me. We've received word 
from the Gillette Squad.

00:18:58.460 --> 00:19:00.400
When Matheus and Zita requested the

00:19:00.400 --> 00:19:02.840
return of the remains and 
cancellation of the tournament,

00:19:02.840 --> 00:19:04.650
King Hartgen placed them in confinement.

00:19:05.330 --> 00:19:09.330
It also says the white Chaika and 
red Chaika are in the tournament...

00:19:10.160 --> 00:19:12.920
And that there are two 
girls with King Hartgen

00:19:12.920 --> 00:19:16.340
who are believed to be Chaikas.

00:19:16.930 --> 00:19:19.300
There were already Chaikas there...

00:19:19.570 --> 00:19:24.310
Does this mean King Hartgen 
also wishes for war?

00:19:30.830 --> 00:19:32.770
What is next battle?

00:19:32.770 --> 00:19:33.820
This way.

00:19:34.730 --> 00:19:36.690
This tournament's surprisingly easy, huh?

00:19:38.000 --> 00:19:38.950
Go.

00:19:44.440 --> 00:19:45.400
What you do?!

00:19:45.400 --> 00:19:46.540
What's the idea?!

00:19:46.850 --> 00:19:48.910
Your team violated the rules.

00:19:48.910 --> 00:19:50.520
Violated rules?

00:19:50.520 --> 00:19:53.750
Your teammate was using probing magic in the

00:19:53.750 --> 00:19:56.140
barracks to locate the emperor's remains.

00:19:56.140 --> 00:19:57.210
Selma...

00:19:57.560 --> 00:19:59.460
Keep walking forward.

00:19:59.460 --> 00:20:01.470
That's where your next fight will be.

00:20:01.470 --> 00:20:02.770
Let out!

00:20:05.710 --> 00:20:07.790
We have no choice but to go forward.

00:20:11.030 --> 00:20:14.000
Your team may advance to 
the next battlefield.

00:20:19.990 --> 00:20:23.910
To win here, you must defeat 
two opposing teams.

00:20:24.420 --> 00:20:26.630
Those who win, in the same manner 
as in the previous battle,

00:20:26.630 --> 00:20:28.870
are to take the arm bands from the losers.

00:20:29.560 --> 00:20:32.250
No one here has any backbone.

00:20:32.700 --> 00:20:35.510
It's not the tournament 
participants we're up against.

00:20:35.910 --> 00:20:37.380
It's the guys inside the castle.

00:20:37.380 --> 00:20:41.380
Oh, yeah! The guy you and Toru called 
your mentor is there, right?

00:20:41.720 --> 00:20:43.390
That'll be exciting.

00:20:51.690 --> 00:20:53.770
Come, swirling vortex!

00:20:53.770 --> 00:20:54.900
The Tornado!

00:21:00.990 --> 00:21:03.080
Come, that which bursts 
and scatters its mark!

00:21:03.080 --> 00:21:04.520
The Burster!

00:21:11.910 --> 00:21:13.250
Defeat, success!

00:21:16.350 --> 00:21:18.490
To a degree, I expected it,

00:21:18.490 --> 00:21:20.840
but if there are black Chaikas in the castle,

00:21:21.280 --> 00:21:24.030
they'll be trying to gather the remains, too.

00:21:24.790 --> 00:21:28.330
This isn't just a matter of stealing 
remains from heroes anymore.

00:21:28.330 --> 00:21:29.260
Yes.

00:21:29.260 --> 00:21:31.790
This means, even if we try to steal them,

00:21:31.790 --> 00:21:34.730
they might try to steal 
the remains we have, too.

00:21:35.440 --> 00:21:38.350
And they've got Brother Shin, 
which makes things tough for us.

00:21:38.350 --> 00:21:40.740
But I think we should strike first.

00:21:41.290 --> 00:21:42.350
Is that all right?

00:21:42.350 --> 00:21:44.740
Of course. Must get remains.

00:21:45.530 --> 00:21:47.800
Twin black Chaikas, curious.

00:21:47.800 --> 00:21:51.910
But, want to overcome crisis with Toru.

00:21:51.910 --> 00:21:54.420
I will finish! I must!

00:23:25.640 --> 00:23:27.990
Martial arts tournament, finally starting!

00:23:27.990 --> 00:23:30.190
Will participate, do my best!

00:23:30.190 --> 00:23:33.640
But, feel eyes watching me, somewhere.

00:23:33.640 --> 00:23:36.220
Who? What is goal?

00:23:36.220 --> 00:23:37.500
Mystery deepens...

00:23:36.680 --> 00:23:40.190
The Bells of Contention

00:23:37.860 --> 00:23:40.190
Next time: "The Bells of Contention."
